Astra と同じ Cybersecurity: Critical。</small><span class=\\\"tl-price-badge\\\">$20.00 / $100.00 ・限定提供</span>\",\n    \"desc_en\": \"OpenAI's cyber-specialized model. The System Card says, verbatim: &ldquo;cyber-specialized variant of GPT-6 Astra designed for authorized security work, including tasks such as vulnerability discovery, exploit development, and web pentesting&rdquo;. It uses specialized training to stay within authorized scope, scores <strong>48.5%</strong> on ExploitGym (GPT-5.6 Cyber: 32.1%), and avoided out-of-scope services in <strong>99.93%</strong> of tests without its deployment prompt (100% with it). Pricing is <strong>$20.00 input / $100.00 output per 1M tokens</strong>, $2.00 cached input, with cache writes at $25.00 (30m) / $50.00 (12h). Access is <strong>gated</strong>: verbatim, &ldquo;initially available through the API and Codex to a select group of approved Daybreak Red customers&rdquo; and &ldquo;We will progressively expand access to all Daybreak Red customers soon&rdquo;. <br><small>Note: a separate line from GPT-6 Sol / Terra; its Preparedness Framework designations match GPT-6 Astra (Critical in Cybersecurity).</small><span class=\\\"tl-price-badge\\\">$20.00 / $100.00 · limited access</span>\"\n   },\n   \"shown_on\": [\n    \"timeline\",\n    \"pricing\",\n    \"calculator\"\n   ],\n   \"sources\": [\n    {\n     \"url\": \"https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-6-cyber/\",\n     \"fetched_at\": \"2026-11-21\",\n     \"quote\": \"GPT‑6 Cyber is initially available through the API and Codex to a select group of approved Daybreak Red customers. / On ExploitGym, which tests whether models can exploit a specified vulnerability, GPT‑6 Cyber scores 48.5%, up from 32.1% for GPT‑5.6 Cyber. / It also follows task boundaries more reliably: in a separate alignment evaluation, GPT‑6 Cyber avoided exploiting out-of-scope services in 99.93% of tests without its deployment prompt, and 100% with this prompt.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"url\": \"https://deploymentsafety.openai.com/gpt-6-cyber\",\n     \"fetched_at\": \"2026-11-21\",\n     \"quote\": \"GPT-6 Cyber is a cyber-specialized variant of GPT-6 Astra designed for authorized security work, including tasks such as vulnerability discovery, exploit development, and web pentesting. / Under our Preparedness Framework, we give GPT-6 Cyber the same capability designations as GPT-6 Astra: Critical in Cybersecurity, High in the Biological and Chemical domain, and below High in AI Self-Improvement.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"url\": \"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/pricing\",\n     \"fetched_at\": \"2026-11-21\",\n     \"quote\": \"Prices per 1M tokens. | CyberTrusted Access: [Daybreak](https://openai.com/daybreak/) | gpt-6-cyber | $20.00 | $100.00 | $2.00 | $25.00 | $50.00 |\"\n    }\n   ],\n"}]}